on": "B2B销售客户快速洞察工具。首次录入卖方产品信息建立匹配锚点，后续仅需输入买方公司名，自动生成6维销售情报报告。", "description_zh": "B2B销售客户快速洞察工具。首次录入卖方产品信息建立匹配锚点，后续仅需输入买方公司名，自动生成6维销售情报报告。", "downloads": 76, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_8c72c6cb/hongweisun02", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "to B销售：客户洞察助手", "ownerName": "user_8c72c6cb", "score": 24126.984126984127, "slug": "hongweisun02", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780940799363, "version": "1.2.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778261497794, "description": "This skill should be used whenever the user sends one or more Etsy listing URLs (containing etsy.com/listing/ or similar formats), or provides Etsy CSV data files for analysis. It automates the full competitor analysis workflow: launching Chrome with the user's local cookies to bypass anti-bot protection, extracting the fully-rendered page HTML via Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP), parsing product data from JSON-LD structured data, and generating comprehensive HTML competitor analysis reports. For multiple URLs or CSV data, it generates a multi-product comparison report with keyword analysis, pricing strategy, and market opportunity insights. Trigger phrases include any Etsy listing URL(s), \"帮我分析这个竞品\", \"分析Etsy链接\", \"Etsy竞品分析\", \"批量分析\", \"多个竞品\", CSV file analysis, or similar requests.", "description_zh": ">当用户发送一条或多条 Etsy 商品链接（包含etsy.com/listing/或同类格式），或是提供 Etsy CSV 数据文件要求分析时，即可启用该功能。它可实现完整竞品分析流程自动化：调用谷歌浏览器并加载用户本地 Cookie 以绕过反机器人防护机制，通过 Chrome 开发者工具协议（CDP）提取完整渲染后的网页超文本标记语言，从 JSON-LD 结构化数据中解析商品信息，并生成完整的 HTML 格式竞品分析报告。若为多条链接或 CSV 数据，还可生成多商品对比报告，包含关键词分析、定价策略及市场机会洞察。触发指令包括任意 Etsy 商品链接、帮我分析这个竞品、分析 Etsy 链接、Etsy 竞品分析、批量分析、多个竞品、CSV 文件分析及其他同类需求表述。", "downloads": 76, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_0f1364e5/etsy-analyze", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "EtsyAnalyze", "ownerName": "user_0f1364e5", "score": 23899.37106918239, "slug": "etsy-analyze", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780938872025, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1777795647220, "description": "Generate an interactive treemap visualization for any topic. Given a theme, the skill searches for items, scores them via LLM, and produces a standalone dark-themed HTML treemap — similar to karpathy.ai/jobs.", "description_zh": "用于分析不同行业的市场占有和商业版图", "downloads": 76, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_268e6861/dfdf54554", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "商业版图分析skill", "ownerName": "user_268e6861", "score": 23676.01246105919, "slug": "dfdf54554", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780938146625, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779010468137, "description": "C++代码分析与解释工具。当用户粘贴C++代码并要求解释其用途、分析关键字用法、理解代码逻辑时使用此技能。触发词包括「解释这段C++代码」「这段代码是什么意思」「C++关键字用法」「分析C++代码」等。", "description_zh": "C++代码分析与解释工具。当用户粘贴C++代码并要求解释其用途、分析关键字用法、理解代码逻辑时使用此技能。触发词包括「解释这段C++代码」「这段代码是什么意思」「C++关键字用法」「分析C++代码」等。", "downloads": 76, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_889ced6f/cpp-2026517", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "C++字典", "ownerName": "user_889ced6f", "score": 23384.615384615383, "slug": "cpp-2026517", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780937411851, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779010426844, "description": "文件格式转换工具，支持 Markdown 转 HTML、Markdown 转 PDF、CSV 转 Excel、图片格式转换（PNG/JPG/WEBP 等互转）。当用户需要转换文件格式时使用此技能。触发词：转换、转为、转成、convert to、markdown to html、csv to excel、图片转换、格式转换。", "description_zh": "文件格式转换工具，支持 Markdown 转 HTML、Markdown 转 PDF、CSV 转 Excel、图片格式转换（PNG/JPG/WEBP 等互转）。当用户需要转换文件格式时使用此技能。触发词：转换、转为、转成、convert to、m